{"4151050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Divided Empire: SENGOKU", "steam_appid": 4151050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/15f252241a72ed8e5acc7b11e3ced906.poster.avif?t=1762437113\" width=750 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/15f252241a72ed8e5acc7b11e3ced906.webm?t=1762437113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the war-torn world of Sengoku-era Japan, where rival clans clash for dominance and the title of Shogun hangs in the balance. As the leader of your clan, you must navigate a landscape of shifting alliances, brutal warfare, and political intrigue. Expand your domain through clever diplomacy, masterful strategy, and decisive battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/59a9a90a7f89a91fced42fc8c14dffbb.webp?t=1762437113\" width=750 height=38 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Leadership</strong>: Manage resources, develop your territory, and command great armies against your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cunning Diplomacy</strong>: Form alliances, negotiate trade, and manipulate the political landscape to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Warfare</strong>: Engage in real-time battles where terrain, weather, and army composition affect the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Selection</strong>: Choose from a wide array of historical clans, all with their own traits and ambitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Campaigns</strong>: No two playthroughs are the same - adapt to shifting threats and changing conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/aa475e09ab43b94091e65c0286df1add.webp?t=1762437113\" width=750 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you rule with honor, deception, or sheer force, the fate of Japan rests in your hands. Will you rise above the ashes of war and claim the title of Shogun - or be forgotten in the tides of history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/f78f23a2a292581b9bbf83a2c175b0e3.poster.avif?t=1762437113\" width=750 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/f78f23a2a292581b9bbf83a2c175b0e3.webm?t=1762437113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divided Empire: SENGOKU</strong> is set to release in 2026. Add it to your wishlist today and be notified when it releases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also consider following the game to get development updates and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/65a37bd4be7321db7650aa696e5cdad4.webp?t=1762437113\" width=750 height=32 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151050/extras/1